  message: "SATISFIED — cli-input sub-C (registry-membership validation) META closes: all members resolved. Every CLI flag whose semantics require a registry lookup now rejects non-registry values with a did-you-mean hint (verified live @ dev 1386628b52): config language (INV-gufod satisfied + INV-subak satisfied — 'notalanguage' -> rc=2 'not a known language'), search --kind/--language (INV-votop satisfied — 'boguskind'/'bipbop' -> rc=2 + 'Did you mean'), sketch --require-section (WI-furop done), verify-claims boundary axis (WI-ruzib done), and the --input view discriminator (INV-gapib satisfied — wrong view -> rc=2, PR #538). No registry-backed flag proceeds silently on a non-registry value. Advances the INV-fabov umbrella (sub-A INV-somut satisfied; sub-B INV-dunof pending only INV-jibof)."  # 546c
